[00:15.58]1. Jehovah our God, exalted in might,
[00:25.84]Creator of life and Provider of light.
[00:33.54]Creation speaks of your power so grand;
[00:40.02]The heavens and earth forever stand.
[00:50.62]2. Your heavenly throne, on justice it stands.
[00:58.86]To us you make known all your righteous commands.
[01:06.68]And as we turn to your Word, we can see
[01:14.62]Your wisdom revealed so brilliantly.
[01:54.64]3. The greatest of all is your perfect love.
[02:03.66]Beyond all compare are your gifts from above.
[02:10.76]Your attributes and your glorious name,
[02:18.08]With joy and with zeal, we will proclaim.
